<法規>
<法規性質>命令</法規性質>
<英文法規名稱>Fee-charging Standards for Application of Launch Vehicles and Spacecraft Registration</英文法規名稱>
<中文法規名稱>發射載具及太空載具申請登錄收費標準</中文法規名稱>
<法規網址>https://law.moj.gov.tw/Eng/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0160091</法規網址>
<最新英文異動日期>20241023</最新英文異動日期>
<廢止註記>
</廢止註記>
<附件 />
<沿革內容><![CDATA[1.Promulgated on October 23, 2024]]></沿革內容>
<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards are established in accordance with Article 10, Paragraph 1 of the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Applicants for the registration of launch vehicles in accordance with Article 10, Paragraph 1 of the Space Development Act shall pay a review fee. The review fee for each application for sounding rocket is NT$22,000, and the fee for each application for orbital launch vehicle is NT$75,000.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Applicants for the registration of spacecraft in accordance with Article 10, Paragraph 1 of the Space Development Act shall pay a review fee. The review fee for each application is NT$16,000.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Receipts shall be issued when fees are collected in accordance with these Standards.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[After the payment of the review fees stipulated in these Standards, no refunds or retention shall be requested for any reason, except in cases where the applicant is eligible for a refund under the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 6</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[If the competent authority withdraws or revokes the registration of a launch vehicle or spacecraft after it has been registered in accordance with Articles 19 or 20 of the Regulations for Registration of Launch Vehicles and Spacecraft, the review fee originally paid shall not be refunded.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 7</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards shall come into force as of the date of promulgation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
